                "textId": "Performance_1999990038_1583453646_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "{A豆豆眼}啵！？\n怎、怎么了？\n难道，你不是，姐姐？",
